QuestGuidance.Register("en",139,{
[4417]="7002F0F2\n1\tFind a matching helm and wear it before the model\030Find matching shoulders and wear it before the model\030Find a matching chest and wear it before the model\030Find matching hands and wear it before the model\030Find matching legs and wear it before the model\030Find matching feet and wear it before the model\tScraps of clothing can be found in crates spread around Harwick.\n2\tTalk to Garbrand\tGarbrand is at Harwick. Inform Garbrand you have dressed up in all the matching gear.\n",
[4418]="70030DDD\n1\tWait for the next round of dressage to begin\tThe dressage rider is in a field behind the fountain in Cliving. Gladsnel has challenged you to perform a course of dressage practice.\n2\tThe dressage rider is in a field behind the fountain in Cliving. Gladsnel has challenged you to perform a course of dressage practice. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\t\n3\tWait for the next move\tThe dressage rider is in a field behind the fountain in Cliving. Gladsnel has challenged you to perform a course of dressage practice.\n4\tThe dressage rider is in a field behind the fountain in Cliving. Gladsnel has challenged you to perform a course of dressage practice. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\t\n5\tWait for the next move\tThe dressage rider is in a field behind the fountain in Cliving. Gladsnel has challenged you to perform a course of dressage practice.\n6\tThe dressage rider is in a field behind the fountain in Cliving. Gladsnel has challenged you to perform a course of dressage practice. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\t\n7\tWait for the next move\tThe dressage rider is in a field behind the fountain in Cliving. Gladsnel has challenged you to perform a course of dressage practice.\n8\tThe dressage rider is in a field behind the fountain in Cliving. Gladsnel has challenged you to perform a course of dressage practice. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\t\n9\tWait for the next move\tThe dressage rider is in a field behind the fountain in Cliving. Gladsnel has challenged you to perform a course of dressage practice.\n10\tThe dressage rider is in a field behind the fountain in Cliving. Gladsnel has challenged you to perform a course of dressage practice. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\t\n11\tTalk to Gladsnel\tGladsnel is at Cliving. Gladsnel will be surprised to hear that you passed the dressage practice.\n",
[4419]="7001E997\n1\tDefeat Wargs in the Ashenslades (total: 15)\030Collect Warg-teeth (total: 10)\tWargs can be found throughout the Ashenslades, but many are gathered to the south of Mithechad, near Naur-hoit. Perindúr has asked you to hunt down and defeat the Wargs of the Ashenslades.\n2\tTalk to Perindúr at Mithechad\tPerindúr is at Mithechad, north of Naur-hoit. You should return to Perindúr and tell him of your success in the hunt.\n",
[4420]="7006AE17\n1\tDestroy dwellings (total: 3)\tSearch Harkhaphâr and destroy the largest dwellings in an attempt to push them elsewhere in the catacombs.\n2\tTalk to Bâkhadir outside of the camp\tReturn to Bâkhadir located just north of Harkhaphâr and inform him of your progress.\n",
[4421]="7000EF7D\n1\tDefeat the Great Snow-matron\tThe Great Snow-matron can be found in the western tundra. Defeating the Snow-matron will frighten the yeti herd and turn them against the Gauredain.\n2\tTalk to Sampo\t\n",
[4422]="7000E39D\n1\tDefeat the red-fang behemoth\tThe red-fang behemoth can be found among the dark rocky hills far to the south-west of Kauppa-kohta. Valtteri has asked you to hunt down and defeat the red-fang behemoth, using a burning Lossoth token to frighten the beast.\n2\tTalk to Valtteri\tValtteri is in the northern part of Kauppa-kohta. You should return to Valtteri and tell him of your victory against the red-fang behemoth.\n",
[4423]="7000A8B9\n1\tRescue tortured prisoners (total: 3)\tPrisoners are being drowned by Angmarim torturers off the docks of the Port of Annúminas, on the lowest level of the city, by the water.\n2\tTalk to Orchalwë\tOrchalwë will be pleased to hear that the prisoners have been saved.\n",
[4424]="7002CB79\n1\tThrow cursed treasures into the Limlight (total: 6)\tThe treasures are strewn about the southern side of Ost Celebrant on the shore near the Limlight River.\n2\tTalk to Doron\tDoron is at your side in Ost Celebrant. If he has wandered from your sight, he can be summoned with your horn.\n",
[4425]="7000C388\n1\tDefeat Kaushar\030Defeat Goblin-town lashers (total: 8)\tGoblin-town is to the north-east of Glóin's camp. Vighar has asked you to find your way through the stronghold to the area where the troll-drummers are watched over by the lashers. Kill several of these goblins and their leader, Kaushar.\n2\tSpeak with Vighar at Glóin's camp outside of Goblin-town\tVighar Roadwalker is at Glóin's camp just outside of Goblin-town. Kaushar and the lashers used their trolls against you, but you were successful in defeating them. You should now return to Vighar with your report.\n",
[4426]="7000C380\n1\tDefeat Cave-troll Drummer (total: 6)\tTroll-drummers can be found in the deep places of Goblin-town. Oghûk wants to exact vengeance on Kaushar, a goblin who mends the drums in the deep places of Goblin-town. He blames Kaushar for his imprisonment and wants to cause him suffering and pain. It is an unpleasant task, but Oghûk will not help you if you do not help him first.\n2\tReturn to Oghûk at his cell in the Goblin-town prison\tOghûk is in his cell in the Goblin-town prison. The troll-drummers were found in an area deep within Goblin-town. Watched over by goblin-taskmasters, you found the trolls and defeated them as requested.\n",
[4427]="70015473\n1\tDestroy the drums (total: 6)\tThe goblin-drummers are encamped in the Hall of the High Stair, north of the Chamber of the Crossroads. Fostólf has asked you to destroy the goblin-drums so that he and his companions can get some sleep.\n2\tTalk to Fostólf in the Chamber of the Crossroads\tFostólf is at the Chamber of the Crossroads, south of the Hall of the High Stair. All of the goblin drums have been silenced. Fostólf should be able to get some rest at last.\n",
[4428]="70044115\n1\tMorgul-troll drummers defeated ([see journal]/4)\tMorgul-troll drummers have arrived on the field. Defeat them quickly to stem the tide of frenzied Morgul-orcs.\n",
[4429]="700442DA\n1\tMorgul-troll drummers defeated ([see journal]/6)\tMorgul-troll drummers have arrived on the field. Defeat them quickly to stem the tide of frenzied Morgul-orcs.\n",
[4430]="7002604F\n1\tPlace the pipe-weed on the drying racks (total: 3)\tThe drying racks are north-east of Blossom Gamgee on Northcotton Farm. The sorted pipe-weed needs to be placed on the drying racks.\n2\tTalk to Blossom Gamgee\tBlossom Gamgee is on Northcotton Farm. Blossom Gamgee will want to know the pipe-weed has been placed on the drying racks.\n",
[4431]="7005F6B9\n1\tDisarm piles of goblin sapper-bombs Defeat goblin-sappers\tGoblin sapper-bombs can be found at Drúkala. Goblin-sappers can be found at Drúkala and roaming within Gloomingtarn. After discovering the destructive potential of the Orcs and goblins now encamped in Gloomingtarn, you have resolved to disarm their bombs and defeat their goblin-sappers before any more harm can come to the hallowed cavern.\n2\tDisarm piles of goblin sapper-bombs (total: 10)\030Defeat goblin-sappers (total: 8)\tGoblin sapper-bombs can be found at Drúkala. Goblin-sappers can be found at Drúkala and roaming within Gloomingtarn. After discovering the destructive potential of the Orcs and goblins now encamped in Gloomingtarn, you have resolved to disarm their bombs and defeat their goblin-sappers before any more harm can come to the hallowed cavern.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have disarmed many sapper-bombs and defeated the goblin-sappers invading Gloomingtarn.\n",
[4432]="7005F6BF\n1\tDestroy Orkish banners at Drúkala\tOrkish banners can be found at Drúkala in Gloomingtarn. After discovering the encampment of Drúkala within Gloomingtarn, you have spied several banners of the Orcs of Gundabad. You should destroy the Orkish banners at Drúkala.\n2\tDestroy Orkish banners at Drúkala (total: 8)\tOrkish banners can be found at Drúkala in Gloomingtarn. After discovering the encampment of Drúkala within Gloomingtarn, you have spied several banners of the Orcs of Gundabad. You should destroy the Orkish banners at Drúkala.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have destroyed many Orkish banners at Drúkala.\n",
[4433]="7005F6C2\n1\tDefeat Orcs and goblins at Drúkala\tOrcs and goblins can be found at Drúkala in Gloomingtarn. After gaining entry to Gloomingtarn through the aid of the Iron Crown, the Orcs of Gundabad have made camp at Drúkala. You should defeat Orcs and goblins at Drúkala.\n2\tDefeat Orcs and goblins at Drúkala (total: 14)\tOrcs and goblins can be found at Drúkala in Gloomingtarn. After gaining entry to Gloomingtarn through the aid of the Iron Crown, the Orcs of Gundabad have made camp at Drúkala. You should defeat Orcs and goblins at Drúkala.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have defeated many Orcs and goblins at Drúkala.\n",
[4434]="70066009\n1\tExamine crates of fish (total: 6)\tAnírwen has asked you to inspect crates of fish on the docks of the bay. The docks are in the Dol Amroth bay.\n2\tReturn to Anírwen\tYou should let Anírwen know that you examined many crates of fish. Anírwen is at her shop in Dol Amroth.\n",
[4435]="700561DA\n1\tSkim stones on the pond (total: 4)\tChildren can be found by the pond in the Rohan Eastfold Homesteads. You should join the children in their 'ducks and drakes' game.\n",
[4436]="70042EA4\n1\tDefeat beasts in Southern Ithilien (total: 12)\tBeasts can be found throughout Southern Ithilien. You should defeat beasts in Southern Ithilien.\n2\tSpeak to Duilin\tDuilin is located in Bâr Húrin. You should talk to Duilin.\n",
[4437]="70042E88\n1\tDefeat Haradrim in the ruins\tDuindir is located in the western section of Southern Ithilien. You should defeat Haradrim in the ruins.\n2\tDefeat Haradrim at Duindir (total: 6)\tDuindir is located in the western section of Southern Ithilien. You should defeat Haradrim in the ruins.\n3\tCompleted\tDefeated Haradrim at Duindir.\n",
[4438]="70042E87\n1\tDestroy Haradrim supplies in the ruins\tDuindir is located in the western section of Southern Ithilien. You should destroy Haradrim supplies in the ruins.\n2\tDestroy Haradrim supplies (total: 6)\tDuindir is located in the western section of Southern Ithilien. You should destroy Haradrim supplies in the ruins.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have destroyed the Haradrim supplies.\n",
[4439]="70025B70\n1\tCollect ornamental blades (total: 6)\tTham Andalath is north-east of Tinnudir and east of Tham Ornen. You found a ceremonial weapon in Tham Andalath and believe you should gather more to take to the Rangers of Tinnudir.\n2\tBring the ornamental blades to the Rangers at Tinnudir\tThe Rangers are at Tinnudir, south-west of Tham Andalath. One of the Rangers will be eager to examine the ceremonial blades you found.\n",
[4440]="70037BB9\n1\tSharpen discarded blades (total: 8)\tDiscarded dull blades can be found throughout Brockbridge. Mula has asked you to sharpen the dulled blades that the defenders of Brockbridge have discarded.\n2\tTalk to Herefara\tHerefara is on the northern side of Brockbridge. Mula had instructed you to return to Herefara when you were finished.\n",
[4441]="7006C125\n1\tDestroy Orkish weapons racks (total: 8)\030Defeat Orcs in Tharháth (total: 15)\tDestroy Orkish weapons racks and defeat Orcs in Tharháth, near the Span of Nâmbadir.\n2\tInvestigate the back of the camp\tInvestigate the noise coming from the back of the camp.\n3\tDefeat the Utûgi Devastator\tDefeat the Utûgi Devastator.\n",
[4442]="70066B22\n1\tHunt oxen in Anfalas (total: 10)\tSadrech has asked you to hunt oxen in Anfalas for parts. The Dun Ox herd north of her camp is also a good source of oxen.\n2\tTalk to Sadrech at her camp\tYou have obtained enough ox parts. You should return to Sadrech at her camp.\n",
[4443]="7006ED49\n1\tDefeat Weaponmaster Mâkhragab\030Defeat Ushdâla, Lady of the Pride\tDefeat Weaponmaster Mâkhragab and Ushdâla, Lady of the Pride in Dun Shûma, The King's Fortress.\n2\tDefeat Zidunâm, the Spirit-caller\tDefeat Zidunâm, the Spirit-caller in Dun Shûma, The King's Fortress.\n",
